            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\n\nI am afraid, customization of completion candidates is [explicitly out of scope for 'mini.cmdline'](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/ca9adcfc4e796b292cc9072f4952318ef5a7f6c0/doc/mini-cmdline.txt#L23-L24). It solely relies on built-in Command-line completion, which indeed doesn't work in this situation (and in other parts of `:substitute` command as well).",
